        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Generally, we provide each homeowner with product warranties covering workmanship and materials for one year from the time of closing, and warranties covering structural systems from the time of closing through the statute of repose with the states we operate in, or ten years, whichever is shorter.",
        "start_character": 17786,
        "end_character": 18085
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001576940-26-000005",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001576940-26-000005-53304f8f7cbfe693",
        "accession_number": "0001576940-26-000005",
        "filing_date": "2026-01-29",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we have developed a Vendor Code of Conduct to establish principles, guidelines and standards with respect to the conduct of our vendor business partners.",
        "start_character": 36245,
        "end_character": 36411
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001576940-26-000005",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001576940-26-000005-53304f8f7cbfe693",
        "accession_number": "0001576940-26-000005",
        "filing_date": "2026-01-29",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also offer title, homeowners insurance, and escrow services through our wholly owned subsidiaries, Parkway Title, LLC (which we refer to as “Parkway”), IHL Home Insurance Agency, LLC (which we refer to as “IHL Insurance”), and IHL Escrow Inc.",
        "start_character": 19803,
        "end_character": 20048
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001576940-26-000005",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001576940-26-000005-53304f8f7cbfe693",
        "accession_number": "0001576940-26-000005",
        "filing_date": "2026-01-29",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also sell homes directly through our Century Complete website and utilize the services of independent real estate brokers in many cases.",
        "start_character": 16112,
        "end_character": 16251
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001576940-26-000005",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001576940-26-000005-53304f8f7cbfe693",
        "accession_number": "0001576940-26-000005",
        "filing_date": "2026-01-29",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are often able to offer a new home offering to our customers at prices that are lower than resale and other new home offerings.",
        "start_character": 16473,
        "end_character": 16603
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001576940-26-000005",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001576940-26-000005-53304f8f7cbfe693",
        "accession_number": "0001576940-26-000005",
        "filing_date": "2026-01-29",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are one of the largest homebuilders in the United States and our common shares trade on the New York Stock Exchange under the symbol “CCS.” Since our initial public offering in 2014, we have expanded geographically through the acquisitions of other homebuilders and organic entrance into new markets.",
        "start_character": 2506,
        "end_character": 2809
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001576940-26-000005",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001576940-26-000005-53304f8f7cbfe693",
        "accession_number": "0001576940-26-000005",
        "filing_date": "2026-01-29",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe our operations are prepared to withstand volatility in future market conditions as a result of our product offerings, which both span the home buying segment and focus on affordable price points, our efficiencies in direct construction costs and cycle times, and our current and future inventories of attractive land positions.",
        "start_character": 8025,
        "end_character": 8363
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001576940-26-000005",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001576940-26-000005-53304f8f7cbfe693",
        "accession_number": "0001576940-26-000005",
        "filing_date": "2026-01-29",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We pay particular attention to product design and carefully consider choice of materials in order to provide features that homebuyers today are seeking.",
        "start_character": 17242,
        "end_character": 17394
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001576940-26-000005",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001576940-26-000005-53304f8f7cbfe693",
        "accession_number": "0001576940-26-000005",
        "filing_date": "2026-01-29",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "As of December 31, 2025, we operated in the 16 states and over 45 markets depicted below:",
        "start_character": 2830,
        "end_character": 2919
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001576940-26-000005",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001576940-26-000005-53304f8f7cbfe693",
        "accession_number": "0001576940-26-000005",
        "filing_date": "2026-01-29",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Century Communities, Inc., a Delaware corporation (which we refer to as “we,” “us,” “our,” “CCS,” or the “Company”), together with its subsidiaries, is engaged in the development, design, construction, marketing and sale of single-family attached and detached homes in 16 states.",
        "start_character": 26,
        "end_character": 305
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001576940-26-000005",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001576940-26-000005-53304f8f7cbfe693",
        "accession_number": "0001576940-26-000005",
        "filing_date": "2026-01-29",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "From time to time, we may sell land to other developers and homebuilders where we have excess land positions.",
        "start_character": 8546,
        "end_character": 8655
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001576940-26-000005",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001576940-26-000005-53304f8f7cbfe693",
        "accession_number": "0001576940-26-000005",
        "filing_date": "2026-01-29",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
